Serif",ExpressionUUID->"fc7b140e-9dd7-4732-81d2-10bd3a699947"],

Cell["\<\
This is obvious since the pseudoscalar basis consist of single element, which \
squares to \[PlusMinus]scalar. \
\>", "Text",
