  3.798797966341423*^9, 3.7987979675704737`*^9}},
 FontFamily->
  "Microsoft Sans \
Serif",ExpressionUUID->"9f689f0b-00b6-4020-bdfb-c506f8bf65c5"],

Cell["\<\
This is obvious since the pseudoscalar basis consist of single element, which \
squares to \[PlusMinus]scalar. \
\>", "Text",
